# CoreFlow Autonomous Engine v3.0.0 — SELinux additions.
# The daemon writes its operator state to /data/adb/coreflow (status.json,
# capabilities.json, journal.jsonl, command). No allow rules are shipped by default.
# If AVC denials appear for that directory on a target device, add narrowly scoped
# rules after inspecting them in logcat. Intentionally no broad sysfs/procfs write
# grants, and never set SELinux permissive globally.
